<div
    style="font-family: 'SF Pro Display', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #F8F8F8;"
>
    <div
        style="background-color: #FFFFFF; padding: 40px; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);"
    >
        <div
            style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 2px solid #FF4500;"
        >
            <div
                style="display: inline-block; background-color: #FFF1EC; color: #FF4500; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 16px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;"
            >Yconic VC Accelerator</div>
            <h1
                style="color: #FF4500; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px;"
            >Welcome to Our Founder Community! 🚀</h1>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
            <p>Dear {{applicantName}},</p>

            <p>I'm Yolanda, Head of HR at Yconic VC Accelerator, and I'm
                personally thrilled to inform you that your application has been
                <strong style="color: #FF4500;">accepted</strong>! Our
                AI-powered evaluation system, combined with our team's
                assessment, identified exceptional potential in your vision and
                founding team.</p>

            <div
                style="background-color: #FFF1EC; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 24px 0; border-left: 4px solid #FF4500;"
            >
                <p><strong style="color: #FF4500;">Your Journey Details</strong></p>
                <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 16px 0;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Founder ID:
                        {{applicationId}}</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Team Assessment Score:
                        {{reviewScore}}/100</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <p>What particularly impressed us was your
                {{highlightedStrength}}.
                {{feedback}}
                This aligns perfectly with the innovative founders we aim to
                support in our accelerator program.</p>

            <div
                style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #F8F8F8 0%, #FFF1EC 100%); padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 32px 0;"
            >
                <h2 style="color: #FF4500; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0;">🤝
                    Let's Begin Your Journey</h2>
                <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 16px 0;">
                    {{#each nextSteps}}
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">{{this}}</li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a
                    href="#"
                    style="display: inline-block; background-color: #FF4500; color: white; padding: 16px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 24px; font-weight: 500; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255,69,0,0.2);"
                >Schedule Your Welcome Call →</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div
            style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666; font-size: 14px;"
        >
            <p>Looking forward to our collaboration,<br />Yolanda<br />Head of
                HR, Yconic VC Accelerator</p>
            <p><small>This acceptance is based on our comprehensive AI-driven
                    evaluation process and team assessment.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>